<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 36.52 to 6268.35.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 3.22 to 380.85.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.34.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1654 to 874.</p>
<p>Volume was 447,583,770, compared with 454,475,050 Friday.</p>
